ss": "https://repository.cern/api/records/wqfww-n3j76/access", "communities": "https://repository.cern/api/records/wqfww-n3j76/communities", "communities-suggestions": "https://repository.cern/api/records/wqfww-n3j76/communities-suggestions", "request_deletion": "https://repository.cern/api/records/wqfww-n3j76/request-deletion", "file_modification": "https://repository.cern/api/records/wqfww-n3j76/file-modification", "quota_increase": "https://repository.cern/api/records/wqfww-n3j76/quota-increase", "requests": "https://repository.cern/api/records/wqfww-n3j76/requests"}, "revision_id": 6, "parent": {"id": "5r3gm-32056", "access": {"owned_by": {"user": "52076"}, "settings": {"allow_user_requests": false, "allow_guest_requests": false, "accept_conditions_text": null, "secret_link_expiration": 0}}, "communities": {"ids": ["16b84cf4-d7ce-4807-940f-c418ac7001fc"], "default": "16b84cf4-d7ce-4807-940f-c418ac7001fc", "entries": [{"id": "16b84cf4-d7ce-4807-940f-c418ac7001fc", "created": "2024-04-05T09:08:20.709616+00:00", "updated": "2024-05-23T13:46:32.250415+00:00", "links": {}, "revision_id": 4, "slug": "cms-statistical-models", "metadata": {"title": "CMS statistical models"}, "access": {"visibility": "public", "members_visibility": "public", "member_policy": "open", "record_submission_policy": "open", "review_policy": "closed"}, "custom_fields": {}, "deletion_status": {"is_deleted": false, "status": "P"}, "children": {"allow": false}}]}, "pids": {"doi": {"identifier": "10.17181/5r3gm-32056", "provider": "datacite", "client": "datacite"}}}, "versions": {"is_latest": true, "index": 1}, "is_published": true, "is_draft": false, "pids": {"doi": {"identifier": "10.17181/wqfww-n3j76", "provider": "datacite", "client": "datacite"}, "oai": {"identifier": "oai:oai:repository.cern::wqfww-n3j76", "provider": "oai"}}, "metadata": {"resource_type": {"id": "model", "title": {"cs": "Model", "de": "Modell", "en": "Model", "sv": "Modell"}}, "creators": [{"person_or_org": {"type": "organizational", "name": "CMS Collaboration"}}], "title": "Statistical model for CMS-EXO-24-011", "publisher": "CERN", "publication_date": "2026-03-30", "related_identifiers": [{"identifier": "https://inspirehep.net/literature/3136278", "scheme": "url", "relation_type": {"id": "ismetadatafor", "title": {"de": "Hat Metadaten f\u00fcr", "en": "Is metadata for"}}, "resource_type": {"id": "model", "title": {"cs": "Model", "de": "Modell", "en": "Model", "sv": "Modell"}}}], "rights": [{"id": "cc-by-4.0", "title": {"en": "Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International"}, "description": {"en": "The Creative Commons Attribution license allows re-distribution and re-use of a licensed work on the condition that the creator is appropriately credited."}, "icon": "cc-by-icon", "props": {"url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode", "scheme": "spdx"}}], "description": "<h1>Statistical model for CMS EXO-24-011</h1>\n<p>This resource contains the full statistical model for the paper <em>Search for new physics with dijet angular distributions in proton-proton collisions at sqrt(s) = 13 TeV</em> in which it is descrbied the Measurement of dijet angular distributions in proton-proton collisions at sqrt(s) = 13 TeV corresponding to 138/fb and search for beyond the standard model physics.</p>\n<p>The instructions below include the commands needed to reproduce the workspaces used for the results presented in the publication. For additional technical documentation please consult the <a href=\"https://github.com/cms-analysis/HiggsAnalysis-CombinedLimit/\">CMS Combine documentation.</a></p>\n<h2>Analysis specific instructions</h2>\n<p>Developed using Combine v7 in CMSSW_8_1_0. Later Combine versions up to at least v10.5 should also be fine.</p>\n<p>Each BSM model and mass/energy/coupling point has it's own datacard.</p>\n<p>ADD: <code>chi_datacard13TeV*_ADD[Lambda]_run2.txt</code></p>\n<p>ALP: <code>chi_datacard13TeV*_alp_QCD_fa[fa]_run2.txt</code></p>\n<p>CI: <code>chi_datacard13TeV*<em>cs_nn31nnlo</em>[Lambda]_[type]_run2.txt</code></p>\n<p>DM mediator: <code>chi_datacard13TeV*<em>DMAxial_Dijet_LO_Mphi</em>[mass]<em>1_1p0_1p0_Mar5_gdmv_0_gdma_1p0_gv_0_ga</em>[coupling]_run2.txt</code></p>\n<p>QBH_ADD: <code>chi_datacard13TeV*<em>QBH_ADD6</em>[Lambda]_run2.txt</code></p>\n<p>QBH_RS1: <code>chi_datacard13TeV*<em>QBH_RS1</em>[Lambda]_run2.txt</code></p>\n<p>SMEFT: <code>chi_datacard13TeV*_tripleG_QCD_CG[CG]_run2.txt</code></p>\n<p>First signal process in the card is the QCD+BSM, second signal process is QCD, third process is a dummy background with 10e-20 events (because the combine scripts ask for it).</p>\n<p>Using <code>HiggsAnalysis.CombinedLimit.HiggsJPC:twoHypothesisHiggs</code> (available in the Combine default repository) with parameter x describing the fraction of QCD+BSM and QCD, i.e.&nbsp;QCD+BSM corresponds to x=1 and QCD to x=0.</p>\n<h2>Physics Model</h2>\n<p>HiggsAnalysis.CombinedLimit.HiggsJPC:twoHypothesisHiggs</p>\n<h2>Example how to compute an exclusion limit</h2>\n<p>To obtain BSM energy/mass exclusion limits, for each mass point the limit on signal strength x is computed.</p>\n<pre><code>text2workspace.py -m 12000 chi_datacard13TeV3_ADD12000_run2.txt -P HiggsAnalysis.CombinedLimit.HiggsJPCmodified:twoHypothesisHiggs -o workspace.root\ncombine -m 12000 -M AsymptoticLimits -n ADD workspace.root</code></pre>\n<p>Models with signal strength x&lt;1 are excluded at 95% confidence limit. The crossing point of the signal strenth x with 1 marks the BSM mass/energy/coupling limit.</p>"}, "custom_fields": {}, "access": {"record": "public", "files": "public", "embargo": {"active": false, "reason": null}, "status": "open"}, "files": {"enabled": true, "order": [], "count": 1, "total_bytes": 1026118161, "entries": {"v1.0.tar.gz": {"id": "4b5e37eb-356b-4ed6-ab7e-ba6e22dfb7ef", "checksum": "md5:e31fd7937e6e02f27e9ccea8c1a53bcc", "ext": "gz", "size": 1026118161, "mimetype": "application/gzip", "storage_class": "L", "key": "v1.0.tar.gz", "metadata": {}, "access": {"hidden": false}, "links": {"self": "https://repository.cern/api/records/wqfww-n3j76/files/v1.0.tar.gz", "content": "https://repository.cern/api/records/wqfww-n3j76/files/v1.0.tar.gz/content"}}}}, "media_files": {"enabled": false, "order": [], "count": 0, "total_bytes": 0, "entries": {}}, "status": "published", "deletion_status": {"is_deleted": false, "status": "P"}, "stats": {"this_version": {"views": 43, "unique_views": 43, "downloads": 17, "unique_downloads": 17, "data_volume": 17444008737.0}, "all_versions": {"views": 43, "unique_views": 43, "downloads": 17, "unique_downloads": 17, "data_volume": 17444008737.0}}}
